Como Arquitecto de Software Senior, he diseñado la arquitectura técnica exacta, modular y limpia para integrar la característica **`v1r3-sh`** en **V1R3.DEV**, garantizando un rendimiento óptimo, aislamiento de estilos mediante variables del sistema de temas existente y una experiencia de usuario inmersiva (UX).

A continuación, se detalla el plano técnico completo con las rutas absolutas y el código fuente íntegro de cada componente.

---

## 📁 Estructura de Archivos a Crear / Modificar

1. `/assets/functions/terminalCLI/terminal.css` (Estilos de la consola y efectos CRT).
2. `/assets/functions/terminalCLI/terminal.js` (Lógica del intérprete CLI, comandos y sandbox).
3. `index.html` (Inyección del botón disparador y carga de recursos).

---

### 1. `/assets/functions/terminalCLI/terminal.css`
Crea este archivo con el siguiente contenido completo:

```css
/* ==========================================
   V1R3-SH Terminal CLI Styles
   Path: /assets/functions/terminalCLI/terminal.css
   ========================================== */

:root {
  --term-bg: rgba(10, 15, 12, 0.95);
  --term-border: var(--primary, #00ff66);
  --term-text: var(--text-main, #e0e0e0);
  --term-prompt: var(--accent, #00ff66);
  --term-dim: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  --term-font: 'DM Mono', monospace, monospace;
}

/* Terminal Trigger Button in Navbar */
.v1r3-sh-trigger {
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--term-border);
  color: var(--term-border);
  font-family: var(--term-font);
  padding: 6px 12px;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

.v1r3-sh-trigger:hover {
  background: var(--term-border);
  color: #000;
  box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--term-border);
}

.v1r3-sh-trigger .prompt-symbol {
  font-weight: bold;
}

/* Terminal Modal Overlay */
.v1r3-terminal-overlay {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  z-index: 99999;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
}

.v1r3-terminal-overlay.active {
  opacity: 1;
  pointer-events: auto;
}

/* Terminal Window Container */
.v1r3-terminal-window {
  width: 90%;
  max-width: 800px;
  height: 550px;
  max-height: 90vh;
  background: var(--term-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--term-border);
  box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.2), inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
  border-radius: 6px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
  font-family: var(--term-font);
  position: relative;
  transform: scale(0.95);
  transition: transform 0.25s ease;
}

.v1r3-terminal-overlay.active .v1r3-terminal-window {
  transform: scale(1);
}

/* CRT Scanline Effect Overlay */
.v1r3-terminal-window::after {
  content: " ";
  display: block;
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 50%), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.03), rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.01), rgba(0, 0, 255, 0.03));
  z-index: 10;
  background-size: 100% 3px, 3px 100%;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0.6;
}

/* Terminal Header */
.v1r3-terminal-header {
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--term-border);
  padding: 10px 15px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  user-select: none;
}

.v1r3-terminal-title {
  color: var(--term-border);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}

.v1r3-terminal-controls {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
}

.term-btn {
  width: 12px;
  height: 12px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: none;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.term-btn.close { background: #ff5f56; }
.term-btn.minimize { background: #ffbd2e; }
.term-btn.maximize { background: #27c93f; }

/* Terminal Body & Output Area */
.v1r3-terminal-body {
  flex: 1;
  padding: 15px;
  overflow-y: auto;
  color: var(--term-text);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

.v1r3-terminal-body::-webkit-scrollbar {
  width: 6px;
}
.v1r3-terminal-body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
  background: var(--term-border);
  border-radius: 3px;
}

/* Output styling */
.term-line {
  word-break: break-word;
  white-space: pre-wrap;
}

.term-output-success { color: #27c93f; }
.term-output-warn { color: #ffbd2e; }
.term-output-error { color: #ff5f56; }
.term-output-info { color: var(--term-border); }
.term-output-dim { color: var(--term-dim); }

/* Input Prompt Form */
.v1r3-terminal-input-form {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 10px 15px;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  gap: 8px;
}

.v1r3-prompt-label {
  color: var(--term-prompt);
  font-weight: bold;
  white-space: nowrap;
  user-select: none;
}

.v1r3-terminal-input {
  flex: 1;
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  color: var(--term-text);
  font-family: var(--term-font);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  outline: none;
  caret-color: var(--term-prompt);
}
```

